					<![CDATA[
						 <p>It worked for me, and went a long way to &quot;humanizing&quot; a sociopathic ritual killing machine who can never die. For me, at least.</p> <p>However, there was one thing that I was a little confused on-</p> <blockquote> <p>A man with a smile, but no face.</p> </blockquote> <p>What is this referring to?</p> <p>Edit:</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Spoilers</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;I&nbsp;warned&nbsp;ya.</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>Is it Bundle? Because if so, I'm a complete idiot for not noticing that.</p> </div> </div> </div> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
